<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth overflow-x-hidden">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Studi Kasus: Sistem Helpdesk - Agung Setiawan Nugroho</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 antialiased selection:bg-blue-600 selection:text-white pb-24 overflow-x-hidden">

    <!-- Navbar -->
    <nav class="fixed w-full top-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/10">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <a href="index.html" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition font-medium text-sm">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Kembali ke Beranda
            </a>
            <span class="font-bold text-lg tracking-tight text-white">Agung<span class="text-blue-500">.</span></span>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header / Hero -->
    <header class="pt-32 pb-12 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-blue-500/30 mb-6 inline-block">Web Dev & UI</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">Sistem IT Helpdesk & Ticketing</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">Platform manajemen tiket IT berbasis web yang dibangun dengan Laravel dan Tailwind CSS untuk mengoptimalkan penanganan kendala karyawan.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Gambar Banner Utama -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 mb-12">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=1200" alt="Mockup Helpdesk" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[500px] object-cover rounded-3xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl">
    </div>

    <!-- Info Proyek -->
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-16 py-8 border-y border-white/10">
        <div><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-2">Tipe Proyek</p><p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Proyek Magang Internal</p></div>
        <div><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-2">Peran</p><p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Frontend Dev & UI Designer</p></div>
        <div><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-2">Waktu</p><p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Okt 2026</p></div>
        <div><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-2">Stack / Tools</p><p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Laravel, Tailwind, MySQL</p></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Latar Belakang & Solusi -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
        <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-crosshairs text-blue-500 mr-2"></i> Latar Belakang</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">Sebagai bagian dari program magang, saya ditugaskan mengembangkan sistem pencatatan masalah IT (*ticketing*). Sebelumnya, pelaporan kendala tidak tertata dan sulit dipantau progresnya.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-yellow-500 mr-2"></i> Solusi</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">Saya membangun aplikasi web komprehensif. Saya merancang *database* MySQL, logika rute (*routing*) dengan Laravel MVC, serta antarmuka modern yang membedakan hak akses karyawan pelapor dan Admin IT.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Proses Teknis (Card) -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16 space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Detail Teknis & Implementasi</h3>
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl">
            <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2">1. Perancangan Database Relasional</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Membuat file *migration* untuk tabel `tickets` dengan struktur terperinci, termasuk atribut *enum* untuk `status` (open, in_progress, resolved) dan `prioritas` (rendah, sedang, tinggi).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl">
            <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2">2. Implementasi Pola MVC (Controller & Views)</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Menyusun logika CRUD pada `TicketController` dan merendernya pada file tampilan Blade (indeks, buat, edit). Saya juga menangani masalah konfigurasi *namespace* dan keamanan model.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Galeri -->
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Tangkapan Layar Antarmuka</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?q=80&w=800" class="w-full h-64 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-white/10" alt="Dashboard">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8e8b4b6d7e3?q=80&w=800" class="w-full h-64 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-white/10" alt="Form Pengajuan">
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>